<title>USA: New England stake raised by Bay Pond.</title>
<headline>New England stake raised by Bay Pond.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Pond Partners L.P. said Wednesday it raised its stake in New England Community Bancorp to 230,900 common shares or 6.30 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Bay Pond said its latest transactions include the purchase of 57,500 common between December 3 and January 28 at prices ranging from $15 to $15.1250 per share.</p>
</text>
